        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b33973-dX6PZFF9atOj.jpg"
        },
        "description": "\"Sweet JP\"—a nickname earned for JP's personality and retro style, though most likely from a refusal to mount any form of weapons or upgrades on his race car. Seemingly, the only advantages of JP's car, the Trans Am 20000 WR, are Frisbee's modifications and the Old man's mechanical skills.  One of two human racers to qualify for REDLINE, though through unusual circumstances (default and popular demand). An ambitious and talented racer, JP pushes his driving skill and soul to their limits when he feels the time is right, throwing an extravagant show whilst putting his body and vehicle on the line for the ultimate racing experience.\n~!JP ends up winning Redline together with Sonoshee McLaren.!~ (Source: Wikipedia)",
